# Spikeout: Battle Street (53450029, PAL ISO), Nova and Thor. DRAFT by
# lane.routeprep, 2026-09-26, not played. One file: whether a save/profile is
# made is not known; A accepts a create prompt if one shows.
#
# Evidence: fmv303b hands-off runs (0-0-y-1790433000-1790433161-fmv303b-
# 2432888, Thor, 56 frames) and gamecheck (1790364700-gamecheck-355013,
# Nova, ~3 s per frame): Xbox, SEGA, Sofdec, Dolby, ESRB notice, then a long
# story FMV with subtitles ("Four guys that comprised the legendary Team
# SPIKE..."), then the title "Please press START to begin" (gamecheck f61-
# f65, ~180 s; fmv303b f53, the last frame). Left alone the title loops back
# into the FMV (gamecheck f69). Whether START skips the FMV is not on disk.
#
# Past the title [recalled, low]: a mode menu with the story / street mode
# first, then a character select, then a street fight with gang members.
wait 45
shot boot45
press START                 # [guess] try to skip the story FMV
wait 15
shot boot60
press START                 # [guess] again; on the title it opens the menu
wait 10
shot boot70
wait 100
shot boot170
press START                 # title at ~180 s if nothing skipped [seen gamecheck f61]
wait 8
shot after-title            # OPEN: which of these STARTs the menus took
mark booted
press A                     # [guess] first mode
wait 8
shot menu1
press A                     # [guess] a save / difficulty / confirm
wait 8
shot menu2
press A                     # [guess] character
wait 8
shot char-select
press A
wait 20
shot loading
repeat 4 {
    press A                 # [guess] mission text / intro
    wait 6
    shot intro-a
}
mark gameplay               # [guess] placeholder: move to the first frame with the fighter under control
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 1
    press X
    wait 0.3
    press X
    wait 0.3
    press Y
    wait 0.3
    axis LY mid
    axis LX max
    wait 1
    press X
    wait 0.3
    press A
    wait 0.5
    axis LX min
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
}
